  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core TreeGrid control is a feature-rich hierarchical data grid for displaying tree-structured (parent-child) tabular data. It supports self-referential and hierarchical data binding, lazy loading, virtual scrolling, column resizing, reordering, sorting, filtering, editing (inline, dialog, batch), aggregates, summary rows, column templates, row drag-and-drop, export to Excel/PDF, and accessibility. It is ideal for displaying organizational charts, file systems, bill of materials, and nested data structures in ASP.NET Core applications.",
